Grgo Borić, witness at a Milaković baptism (image 335)||witness to the baptism of Milaković Ferole's child, of Brinje - not in the tree|witness at a baptism|circa 1895|Brinje, Croatia|FamilySearch, Croatia Church Books 1516-1994, Brinje Matična knjiga rođenih 1893-1897 (DGS 005498262, waypoint 9R26-82S), image 335 - the baptism of a child of Milaković Ferole and Hobac Kate, of Brinje (no house number entered, exact date not captured in this image crop), names "BORIĆ GRGO" as a witness alongside a woman named Marica. NOT IN THE TREE. A second sighting of a Borić man witnessing a Milaković baptism - the first (this file, image 239, house 74) also paired him with a woman of a similar name, Marija. Plausibly the same recurring witness, but neither entry names a shared identity; kept as two sightings, not merged.
